===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|epigraphy|typography}} A [[misprint]] (or occasionally a scribal error) that affects a [[letter]]. 
#: {{syn|en|typo}}
# {{lb|en|programming}} A value, as opposed to an [[identifier]], written into the [[source code]] of a computer program.
#: {{syn|en|literal constant}}
# {{lb|en|logic}} A [[propositional calculus|propositional]] [[variable]] or the [[negation]] of a propositional variable.<sup>[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Resolution_%28logic%29]</sup>

